exported HTML / ZIP,embrace.py,"applicable declared task / loaded, empty, busy, failed or recorded result branch","<p>The source selection cap is declared before target testing, not a biological optimum. Source FDR eligibility, ranking, cap and displayed row count are separate decisions. Post-target cap comparisons are exploratory sensitivity analyses. Hedges’ g is a standardized difference, not accuracy. BH q is an adjusted p value; FDR concerns an expected false-discovery proportion under its assumptions, not a probability that a particular hypothesis is true.</p>","Read result-first evidence, methods, limits and reproduction",generated_template,The surrounding source branch and data checks must hold; dynamic values are actual saved or user-supplied fields,"Literal label/message or exact generated view: The source selection cap is declared before target testing, not a biological optimum. Source FDR eligibility, ranking, cap and displayed row count are separate decisions. Post-target cap comparisons are exploratory sensitivity analyses. Hedges’ g is a standardized difference, not accuracy. BH q is an adjusted p value; FDR concerns an expected false-discovery proportion under its assumptions, not a probability that a particular hypothesis is true.",Actual saved result and recorded role; published view wording separate from immutable numeric artifacts,"Specific handler, generated artifact or recorded field at the source location; no invented completion",brace_app/embrace.py:199; sha256=5146e01ecebfde5d6ea53b71d2a89facedc26548285336f38f6b6b580e46ef92,Dynamic declarations are unverified; scientific thresholds and denominators require adjacent definitions or recorded methods,keep,D3_EXPORT
