ACE / record inspector,ace.js,"applicable declared task / loaded, empty, busy, failed or recorded result branch","<p class=""scope-note"">${d.kind==='historical'?'Archived CPTAC predictions · original classifier not rerun.':d.kind==='synthetic'?'Artificial software test · not a biological finding.':'Supplied classification records · acquisition and split are not authenticated.'} Filtering never retrains the model; scores are not assumed calibrated.</p><div class=""ace-comparison"">${info.source_cv?metricPanel(info.source_cv.metrics,'Source out-of-fold cross-validation',info.source_cv.method+' · '+info.source_cv.folds+' folds · seed '+info.source_cv.seed,true):''}${metricPanel(m,d.kind==='historical'?'Historical CPTAC record evaluation':info.source_cv?'Target scoring':'Supplied record evaluation',v.role+' · independence declaration: '+v.independence)}</div>
 <section class=""panel confidence-panel""><h2>Filter predictions by confidence</h2><p class=""help"">Retain when maximum supplied class probability ≥ threshold. Changing the cutoff filters saved records; it does not retrain the model, assess calibration or validate this policy.</p><div class=""confidence-layout""><div><div class=""confidence-controls""><label for=""confidence-range"">Recorded threshold <output id=""threshold-output""></output></label><label for=""confidence-number"" class=""sr-only"">Enter a recorded confidence threshold</label><input id=""confidence-number"" type=""number"" min=""0"" max=""1"" step=""any"" ${hasProb?'':'disabled'}></div><input id=""confidence-range"" type=""range"" min=""0"" max=""${Math.max(0,v.threshold_curve.length-1)}"" step=""1"" value=""${Math.max(0,v.threshold_curve.findIndex(p=>p.threshold===state.threshold))}"" ${hasProb?'':'disabled'}><p id=""threshold-input-error"" role=""alert""></p><p class=""help"">Saved cutoffs: 0.01 steps plus the exact reference ${esc(String(v.threshold))}.</p><p id=""threshold-status"" class=""help""></p><button id=""reset-range"" ${hasProb?'':'disabled'}>Reset to reference ${esc(String(v.threshold))}</button><div id=""confidence-results"" aria-live=""polite""></div></div><div><div id=""confidence-plot""></div><details><summary>Reference intervals and descriptive calibration</summary><div id=""selective-intervals""></div><p class=""help"">Intervals assume independent rows and do not correct grouped dependence. Descriptive 10-bin expected calibration error: ${fmt(info.expected_calibration_error_10bin,4)}. A small observed error does not establish calibration in a new dataset.</p><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(v.calibration_bins,null,2))}</pre></details></div></div></section>
 <section class=""panel""><h2>Confusion counts for all evaluated records</h2>${matrix(m)}</section>
 <section class=""panel""><div class=""section-heading""><h2>Inspect individual predictions</h2><span>${v.n} evaluated records</span></div><div class=""table-controls"">${[['errors','Incorrect predictions'],['all','All records'],['retained','Retained'],['deferred','Withheld']].map(([key,label])=>`<button data-filter=""${key}"" aria-pressed=""${state.filter===key}"" ${!hasProb&&['retained','deferred'].includes(key)?'disabled':''}>${label}</button>`).join('')}<label class=""sr-only"" for=""sample-search"">Search record IDs and labels</label><input id=""sample-search"" type=""search"" aria-label=""Search record IDs and labels"" placeholder=""Record ID, label or group"" value=""${esc(state.query)}""></div><div id=""sample-table""></div></section>
 <section class=""panel""><h2>Class support and per-class scores</h2><p class=""help"">Macro averages include ${m.macro_denominator} true-supported classes of ${m.class_order.length} declared. A class with no true records remains unevaluated.</p><div class=""table-scroll"" tabindex=""0"" role=""group"" aria-label=""Scrollable data table""><table id=""ace-per-class""><thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>True records</th><th>Predicted records</th><th>True positives</th><th>Precision</th><th>Recall</th><th>F1</th><th>Unavailable reason</th></tr></thead><tbody>${m.per_class.map(c=>`<tr><th scope=""row"">${esc(c.class)}</th><td>${c.support}</td><td>${c.predicted_count}</td><td>${c.tp}</td><td>${pct(c.precision)}</td><td>${pct(c.recall)}</td><td>${pct(c.f1)}</td><td>${esc([...new Set(Object.values(c.undefined_reasons).filter(Boolean))].join(', ')||'—')}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><details><summary>Per-class intervals and recorded group composition</summary><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify({classes:m.per_class,groups:v.study_summaries},null,2))}</pre></details></section>
