SPACE public discovery,space.js,"applicable declared task / loaded, empty, busy, failed or recorded result branch","<p>Search official GEO metadata using public research terms. A search result is a candidate, not a prepared or scientifically approved dataset.</p><form id=""space-form""><div class=""cohort-grid""><div><label for=""space-question"">Research question or accession</label><input id=""space-question"" required minlength=""3"" maxlength=""180"" placeholder=""e.g. breast tumor estrogen receptor, or GSE42568""><label for=""space-tissue"">Tissue / population (optional)</label><input id=""space-tissue"" maxlength=""80"" placeholder=""e.g. breast tumor""></div><div><label for=""space-organism"">Organism</label><select id=""space-organism""><option>Homo sapiens</option><option>Mus musculus</option></select><label for=""space-assay"">Assay</label><select id=""space-assay""><option value=""microarray"">Expression microarray</option><option value=""rnaseq"">Bulk RNA-seq</option><option value=""any"">Any expression assay</option></select><label for=""space-task"">Intended task</label><select id=""space-task""><option value=""race"">RACE · association testing</option><option value=""train_validate"">ACE · expression baseline</option><option value=""diagnose_shift"">CE · distribution comparison</option></select></div></div><p class=""help"">Only the public search fields above are sent to NCBI. Uploaded data, private sample labels and patient metadata are never included. RACE currently accepts human normalized log2 microarrays; other search results may be ineligible.</p><div class=""actions""><button id=""space-search"" class=""primary"" type=""submit"">Search public studies ↗</button><button id=""space-accession"" type=""button"">Check files for this GSE accession ↗</button></div><label class=""check""><input id=""space-refresh"" type=""checkbox"">Refresh official metadata instead of using the 24-hour local cache</label></form><div id=""space-status"" role=""status"" aria-live=""polite""></div><div id=""space-results""></div><section id=""space-shortlist"" hidden></section><details><summary>What happens before a candidate becomes usable?</summary><ol><li>Find and review official metadata.</li><li>Verify actual public filenames and original-file hashes.</li><li>Curate sample labels, patient independence, processing and feature identifiers.</li><li>Freeze deterministic preparation, without selecting for target outcomes.</li><li>Run BRACE’s task-specific input checks.</li></ol><p>No automatic label guessing, normalization, study-independence claim or model execution is performed here. Original GEO matrix files require preparation; they are not BRACE-formatted inputs.</p></details><p class=""help""><a href=""https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">NCBI policies and disclaimer</a> · Official data may have study-specific reuse conditions. The bundled ER study remains available offline.</p><button id=""space-local"" class=""text-button"">Use the verified bundled ER example instead</button>","Search official public metadata, compare candidates and acquire bounded original files",generated_template,The surrounding source branch and data checks must hold; dynamic values are actual saved or user-supplied fields,"Literal label/message or exact generated view: Search official GEO metadata using public research terms. A search result is a candidate, not a prepared or scientifically approved dataset. Research question or accession Tissue / population (optional) Organism Homo sapiens Mus musculus Assay Expression microarray Bulk RNA-seq Any expression assay Intended task RACE · association testing ACE · expression baseline CE · distribution comparison Only the public search fields above are sent to NCBI. Uploaded data, private sample labels and patient metadata are never included. RACE currently accepts human normalized log2 microarrays; other search results may be ineligible. Search public studies ↗ Check files for this GSE accession ↗ Refresh official metadata instead of using the 24-hour local cache What happens before a candidate becomes usable? Find and review official metadata. Verify actual public filenames and original-file hashes. Curate sample labels, patient independence, processing and feature identifiers. Freeze deterministic preparation, without selecting for target outcomes. Run BRACE’s task-specific input checks. No automatic label guessing, normalization, study-independence claim or model execution is performed here. Original GEO matrix files require preparation; they are not BRACE-formatted inputs. NCBI policies and disclaimer · Official data may have study-specific reuse conditions. The bundled ER study remains available offline. Use the verified bundled ER example instead",Public terms only; candidates and acquired files are not scientific eligibility approval,"Specific handler, generated artifact or recorded field at the source location; no invented completion",brace_app/static/js/space.js:7; sha256=eb652aeb9439d60e8bc1fd80bde7063dd51dade3770022d49034594244c39bab,Dynamic declarations are unverified; scientific thresholds and denominators require adjacent definitions or recorded methods,keep,V6_DISCOVERY
